  "description": "Hyacinth, an aspiring hero, sets out to defeat the Demon King in hopes of gaining fame. Although her heart is already set on being a hero, she keeps finding herself in dizzying, compromising situations…\n\nInstead of being stabbed by a sword, she finds herself getting 'pierced' by other things—and strangely, she doesn't exactly hate it?\n\nA romantic comedy between an retired Demon King bored with everything and an overly passionate hero.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/the_devi_the_warrior_and)",
